y ideal person.\"  Amane Mashiro is a second year high school girl with a thing for handsome boys with black hair. She's secretary to the student council, and all she can think about is Tsubaki, who looks like her absolute ideal guy.\n\nMeanwhile, Tsubaki is a third year student and president of the student council. He's cool, he takes no nonsense...and when he's with Mashiro, there's one thought looping in his head: \"She's so cute!\"\n\nThe student council watches on as this will-they-won't-they romance unfolds, obvious to everyone but the pair themselves. What will they do when their feelings for each other are finally revealed...?!","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a422d570-fc82-439b-9905-81151eddd7e3/73dff1ad-6f26-42c4-bfaa-0472ef7c7c1e.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["vi","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.72,"follows":2521,"listAt":"2026-10-25T18:53:13.347Z","chapters":[{"id":"fe5e77d6-2bd7-46e2-acbc-0fd21efe9962","number":"11.7","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":3,"createdAt":"2026-10-20T08:54:26+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0be60535-c1ec-4ff1-802e-6d5dd6986cdd","number":"11.6","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":10,"createdAt":"2026-10-20T08:52:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3ea9ca83-baa3-4cd0-9c00-3dcd2d833a24","number":"11.5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T00:48:18+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"55e12852-a711-48fe-9176-5743331f1e97","number":"11","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2026-10-08T23:18:02+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"83547f09-dadf-427a-af3b-0cf5dafd9f2f","number":"10","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2026-10-03T00:12:21+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b387b1c1-adce-47b6-a363-9d43e0712080","number":"9","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":8,"createdAt":"2026-09-22T05